    "detailed_description": "English version release on August 22, 2024.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature yourself on stream! Unpredictable challenges! A game designed for streaming!</h2>**&quot;Go viral as a VTuber \u2013 all it takes is one hit!&quot;** is a social media-inspired simulation game.<br><br>You are the protagonist, the streamer. How many likes can you earn in the 10 days of gameplay?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vertical streaming recommended?</h2>This game is **optimized for vertical streaming**. Since your character is you, make sure to use OBS or other streaming software to show yourself on screen and enjoy streaming this game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse events and multiple endings</h2>This game offers multiple endings. Your **actions over 10 days** will determine your fate. There are also events tied to social media \u2013 expect unpredictable challenges and surprises. This is your chance to showcase your streaming skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay duration</h2>- **When streaming**:  <br>If you narrate the events, you can finish a run in less than an hour. However, engaging with your viewers or certain events may extend the playtime to around two hours.<br><br>- **When not streaming**:  <br>Without narration, a run can be completed in about 30 minutes.  <br><br>With a variety of events and endings, the game is designed for multiple playthroughs.",
